WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Step into a new help-desk role at Northline Logistics, where a printing problem is holding up work.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Start with a demonstration and guided practice. Assess the impact, then set the right priority.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Use the knowledge base to choose an approved action, and document what you actually did.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Next, tackle a different ticket independently: a stalled label queue affecting six packers before dispatch.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Apply the same workflow to new evidence. Choose guidance and an action that fit this problem.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Confirm that work has resumed before closing the ticket. Review your feedback, then retry to improve.
